								[↗]</a> <br/> <span class="text-xs">${$.escape(show.date.getTime() > Date.now() ? 'Scheduled' : 'Published')}
								${$.escape(format(show.date, 'EEE MMM d yyyy h:mm:ss a z'))}</span></td><td>`);

